# One pair per pool, prefixed with its name: the repo it serves, and a
# fine-grained or classic PAT with repo admin (administration:write) on that
# repo — the image self-mints short-lived registration tokens from it, so
# registration survives restarts without manual token refresh. A
# fine-grained PAT covers one owner, so each pool has its own; a classic PAT
# of a user who admins both repos may be pasted in both.
#
# Set every one: while any is empty, the whole stack fails to deploy and the
# running pools stay as they are. Leave nothing after an empty `=`: an
# unquoted "# …" there is read as the value, and gets past that check.

TICKIFY_REPO_URL=https://github.com/stage-crew/tickify
TICKIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN=

OPTICS_REPO_URL=https://github.com/nobinalo/Optics
OPTICS_ACCESS_TOKEN=
